Apple today updated its online refurbished store in the United States, <a href="https://www.apple.com/shop/refurbished/iphone/iphone-16e">adding the iPhone 16e</a>. Refurbished iPhone 16e models are available at discounted prices for the first time since the device launched in February 2025.<br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2025/02/iPhone-16e-Feature.jpg" alt="" width="2500" height="1406" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-990895" /><br/>
